
  ID generation prefers [38;5;153mcrypto.randomUUID()[39m, falling back to a [38;5;153mcrypto.getRandomValues[39m UUIDv4. The fallback isn't
  theoretical: [38;5;153mcrypto.randomUUID[39m requires a secure context, and you chose to keep the page openable over [38;5;153mfile://[39m, where
  that guarantee varies by browser.

